cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research code or its certified artifacts, cite this repository and the primary papers listed in sources/bibliography.bib."
title: "qec-codesign: automated co-design of quantum LDPC codes, syndrome circuits, and decoders"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "qec-codesign contributors"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-13
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Exact GF(2) validation, distance certification, mixed-stabilizer syndrome
  compilation, circuit-level simulation, decoder benchmarking, and searchable
  artifacts for perturbed and CSS bivariate-bicycle codes.
keywords:
  - quantum error correction
  - quantum LDPC codes
  - bivariate bicycle codes
  - syndrome extraction
  - circuit-level noise
